  "body": "Release 0.13.0 (minor - the user's call: the new Linux/macOS release packages make it a feature release; no commit since v0.12.1 carries a `feat` type, the packaging PRs came in as build/untyped).\n\n- Merged since v0.12.1: issue #84 (PR #90), issue #91 (PR #97), issue #96 (PR #105), issue #71 (PR #115); packaging by linuxguy123: PR #95 (Linux TAR.GZ/DEB/RPM), PR #98 (macOS ZIP/DMG, AppImage, Snap, Flatpak), PR #102 (AppImage startup), PR #114 (Arch source package); CI/docs: PRs #88, #92, #94, #99, #100, #101.\n- This branch: RELEASE_NOTES.md (0.13.0 section only), CHANGELOG.md rows (7), the version bump.\n- Release gate (scripts/release.ps1: all debug suites, ui, clippy -D warnings, release --ignored heavy lanes): green, 0 failures. Zip built; no installer locally (ISCC not installed - the GitHub Windows job builds it).\n- Tagging v0.13.0 runs release.yml's Windows, Linux, macOS, Snap and Flatpak jobs for the first time on a real tag, and the new template release page.\n\nChangelog: none (release mechanics)",
